{"status":"completed","summary":"Built and verified the requested load-balanced HTTP service. Nginx serves node identifiers on port 5660 across node1-node3; HAProxy serves port 80 on node4 with round-robin balancing and active health checks. Failover and persistence across all four node restarts passed.","actions_performed":["Installed, configured, and enabled Nginx on node1-node3.","Installed, configured, and enabled HAProxy on node4.","Verified balanced traffic across all healthy backends.","Stopped node2 Nginx and confirmed uninterrupted service through node1/node3, then restored full health.","Restarted node1, node2, node3, and node4 sequentially and verified changed boot IDs and complete recovery."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Each backend serves its node identifier from `/` on port 5660","command_ids":["cmd-945f4ed2a253463e","cmd-be766350a04c4491","cmd-5d30b122d4ce481d"],"summary":"Post-restart checks show active, enabled Nginx listeners on port 5660 returning node1, node2, and node3 respectively."},{"requirement":"HAProxy serves port 80 and distributes requests across healthy backends","command_ids":["cmd-9772e5572e6142db","cmd-ee17540ac965437c"],"summary":"HAProxy listened on port 80, distributed requests equally across all three nodes, and reported every member UP/L7OK with HTTP 200."},{"requirement":"Service remains available when one backend fails","command_ids":["cmd-9772e5572e6142db","cmd-27bc2da77a22428f","cmd-1f72152372f44b0f","cmd-2232ac66e8e141e4","cmd-1a8e3c6888d84780"],"summary":"After stopping node2 Nginx, HAProxy marked node2 DOWN and served 30/30 requests through node1/node3. Node2 was restored and the full pool returned UP."},{"requirement":"node1 mandatory restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-2b91aa441c7c46f0","cmd-ae4be087c6b64b40","cmd-4ebd5e404ae64bd3","cmd-945f4ed2a253463e","cmd-383a8de607d246fe"],"summary":"Healthy baseline and reboot acknowledgement were captured; boot ID changed, Nginx recovered with its content, and HAProxy restored all three members."},{"requirement":"node2 mandatory restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-7ad0a422fcde41a2","cmd-320f8f48e59f42c8","cmd-005aa595b6724e71","cmd-be766350a04c4491","cmd-28a638d338fb45ae"],"summary":"Healthy baseline and reboot acknowledgement were captured; boot ID changed, Nginx recovered with its content, and HAProxy restored all three members."},{"requirement":"node3 mandatory restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-5d7f5ce800c244c4","cmd-313f1b42ec9f4acc","cmd-94011bad1a8744e5","cmd-5d30b122d4ce481d","cmd-9032d0b105b44d72"],"summary":"Healthy baseline and reboot acknowledgement were captured; boot ID changed, Nginx recovered with its content, and HAProxy restored all three members."},{"requirement":"node4 mandatory restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-b067f97c27774259","cmd-6bb992bdb0404ed1","cmd-26786ac36bb34ec4","cmd-ee17540ac965437c"],"summary":"Healthy HAProxy baseline and reboot acknowledgement were captured; boot ID changed, HAProxy recovered enabled and active on port 80, and all three backends returned UP/L7OK."}]}
